<p>I <em>think</em> the popup comes from <code>src/UI/DynamicTooltip.cpp</code>, but I got lost in that code. So instead, since the question is about drawing a red line in the popup, the following works fine for me (but obviously that is not the line where you want it to be - it is just a proof of concept):</p>
